\newlabel{fig:pos}{{2}{5}{PCA (left half of each panel) and t-SNE (right half) projections of best-layer embeddings coloured by POS tag. Both models show clear syntactic clustering at their peak RT-predictive layers, with t-SNE revealing well-separated category islands}{figure.caption.16}{}}
